## 4. Cursor strengths to match (parity)

- ✅ Dedicated planning phase before code changes  
- ✅ Structured steps the user can see  
- ✅ Explicit user confirmation to build/execute  
- ✅ Progress through steps during execution (`manage_plan` → merge by id + live PlanPanel)  
- ✅ Ability to refine the plan from conversation (edit panel + Revise + revision log)

