## 5. Cursor weaknesses → Vigil improvements (beat Cursor)

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Clarity & control
- ✅ **True editability** of steps before execute
- ✅ **Reorder by up/down**
- ✅ **Optional / must** step flags
- ✅ **Acceptance checks** per step

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Continuity
- ✅ Plans **persist** and are resumable after pause / Stop (History + reopen)
- ✅ Mid-run Stop doesn’t orphan the plan
- ✅ “Continue plan” restores from plan statuses + resume/retry prompts

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Grounding in large repos (Vigil advantage)
- ✅ Plan generation cites paths/symbols via agent prompt + user-editable hints
- ✅ Steps attach `hints.files` / `hints.symbols` / commands
- ✅ Prefer `parallel_investigate` during Plan mode (system prompt)

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Parallel & ops awareness
- ✅ Plan can mark steps as `parallelizable`
- ✅ Explicit ops steps flagged (test / CI / PR heuristics + acceptance/hints)
- ✅ Dangerous steps visually flagged (push, delete, migrate heuristic)

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Honesty & anti-drift
- ✅ Agent must not mark a step completed without evidence (execute prompt + acceptance rules; drift banner for off-plan steps)
- ✅ If execution drifts from plan, require **plan amendment** (user-visible)
- ✅ Don’t start coding while still answering “what should we do?” in Plan mode (write-gate until Execute)

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Language & accessibility
- ✅ Plan UI follows Arabic/English from plan title/goal (`looksArabic` labels)
- ✅ Compact, readable steps — details expandable

> **عربي:** تحسينات ضد Cursor

### Privacy / cloud boundary
- ✅ Plan **text/steps** may live in Firestore later via Cloud Bridge — **never** private repo file contents; desktop Execute stays local-only (enforced here + restated in `02`)

---

> **عربي:** علاقتها باللي موجود في Vigil دلوقتي

