6. ✅ **Pause / resume / fail recovery**  
7. ✅ **Plan history** list + reopen (clone / archive / delete)  
8. ✅ **Polish:** parallelizable, acceptance, hints, dangerous flags  
9. ✅ **Close-out:** mid-run mode confirm, auto-suggest Plan, `chatTabId`, revisions diff, ops badges, AR/EN PlanPanel, heuristics tests  

