## 8. Acceptance criteria (product done)

- ✅ User can discuss a multi-file feature, get a draft plan, edit it, approve, and only then see writes  
- ✅ Stopping mid-run leaves a resumable plan  
- ✅ Running plan shows live step statuses in UI  
- ✅ Plan mode cannot apply_patch/write_file before Execute (sidecar-enforced)  
- ✅ Arabic and English goals produce usable plans (language-follow + AR/EN PlanPanel)  
- ✅ Tests cover persistence + write-gate + merge/execute + anti-drift + pause/resume + history/polish + close-out heuristics  

---

> **عربي:** قرارات مقفولة

## 9. Closed decisions

- ✅ Storage interim: `.vigil/plans/` local; Firestore primary when Cloud Bridge ships (`02`)  
- ✅ Auto-enter Plan mode: heuristic suggest on send (`autoSuggestPlanMode`, default on)  
- ✅ Execute spawns a **new agent turn** (Agent + `planExecuteUnlocked`)  
- ✅ `manage_plan` **merges** into the active Plan artifact by step id  

